{"id":"n37059-1-11","stage":4,"title":"그간 · 这期间","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n37059-1-11-1","ko":"승규야, 지난 학기에는 왜 휴학을 했었니?","zh":"承奎，上个学期你为什么休学了？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"승규야,","meaning":"承奎","explanation":"승규：承奎；야：呼格助词，用来称呼关系亲近的人或晚辈。","readings":[{"term":"승규야","audio":"/audio/7df699add291e5b9b746.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"지난","meaning":"过，过去","explanation":"지나다：过，过去；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"지나다","audio":"/audio/7d68e3b7dc1c001cae3b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82142","senseId":"1","lemma":"지나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"학기에는","meaning":"学期","explanation":"학기：学期；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"학기","audio":"/audio/a95c145d8eb8427ea655.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72420","senseId":"1","lemma":"학기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"휴학을","meaning":"休学","explanation":"휴학：休学；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"휴학","audio":"/audio/e8600e922cae3dbeac0c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"87824","senseId":"1","lemma":"휴학","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"했었니?","meaning":"表示实现前面动作的想法。","explanation":"하다：表示实现前面动作的想法。；었었：回顾已经结束或与现在情况有区别的过去。；니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62888","senseId":"2","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"7d68e3b7dc1c001c","term":"지나다","zh":"过，过去","audio":"/audio/7d68e3b7dc1c001cae3b.mp3","entryId":"82142","definition":"随时间流逝，脱离那个时期。","pronunciation":["지나다"]},{"id":"a95c145d8eb8427e","term":"학기","zh":"学期","audio":"/audio/a95c145d8eb8427ea655.mp3","entryId":"72420","definition":"按照学业要求将一个学年划分成的时间段。","pronunciation":["학끼"]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"e8600e922cae3dbe","term":"휴학","zh":"休学","audio":"/audio/e8600e922cae3dbeac0c.mp3","entryId":"87824","definition":"一定时间内不去上学。","pronunciation":["휴학"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示实现前面动作的想法。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"62888","definition":"表示实现前面动作的想法。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/89400ab1ee07a89484bc.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n37059-1-11-2","ko":"말 못할 그간의 사정이 있었어요.","zh":"当时有一些不便说出口的缘故。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"말","meaning":"话，语言","explanation":"말：话，语言","readings":[{"term":"말","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27260","senseId":"2","lemma":"말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"못할","meaning":"没能","explanation":"못하다：没能；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"못하다","audio":"/audio/641e1150cc79b5b24a33.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26838","senseId":"1","lemma":"못하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그간의","meaning":"这期间，这段时间以来","explanation":"그간：这期间，这段时间以来；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"그간","audio":"/audio/20730be9e720e1f48113.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"37059","senseId":"1","lemma":"그간","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사정이","meaning":"处境，情况，原因，缘由","explanation":"사정：处境，情况，原因，缘由；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"사정","audio":"/audio/2389c7672871f28155a7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15669","senseId":"1","lemma":"사정","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있었어요.","meaning":"处于，处在","explanation":"있다：处于，处在；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68796","senseId":"3","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"dfbb3ea79fc80c6f","term":"말","zh":"话，语言","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3","entryId":"27260","definition":"表达想法或感觉的行为或态度。","pronunciation":["말ː"]},{"id":"641e1150cc79b5b2","term":"못하다","zh":"没能","audio":"/audio/641e1150cc79b5b24a33.mp3","entryId":"26838","definition":"表示之前的话所指的行动未能达成或没有做该事的能力。","pronunciation":["모ː타다"]},{"id":"20730be9e720e1f4","term":"그간","zh":"这期间，这段时间以来","audio":"/audio/20730be9e720e1f48113.mp3","entryId":"37059","definition":"从稍微远一些的某个时间到另一个时间的、较短的时期。","pronunciation":["그간"]},{"id":"2389c7672871f281","term":"사정","zh":"处境，情况，原因，缘由","audio":"/audio/2389c7672871f28155a7.mp3","entryId":"15669","definition":"事情的状况及原因。","pronunciation":["사ː정"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"处于，处在","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68796","definition":"人或动物继续保持某种状态。","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/37f031f8ff94199f0031.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.08,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=37059","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":146,"sequenceScore":2.9067,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["当时有一些不便说出口的缘故。","今天举办的独奏会演奏得非常好。","承奎，上个学期你为什么休学了？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["当时有一些不便说出口的缘故。","承奎，上个学期你为什么休学了？","今天举办的独奏会演奏得非常好。"],"answer":0}]}
